  "body": "## Summary\n\n- redesign the admin analytics UI as a route-aware observability dashboard with filters, percentiles, exports, refresh controls, detailed request views, and clearer empty/error/privacy states\n- enforce explicit web-search routing: named providers are strict by default, auto mode can use the configured fallback chain, and disabled mode performs no outbound search\n- add correlated logical-route and per-attempt search telemetry, including provider paths, fallbacks, end-to-end latency, results, cost, and errors\n- document the routing/analytics behavior and bump the release to v4.12.0 with installers pinned to the reproducible wheel SHA-256\n\n## Validation\n\n- `./scripts/ci.ps1 -Skip pytest`: suppression check, Ruff format, Ruff check, and ty all passed\n- full pytest suite: 2,991 passed, 38 skipped\n- focused integrated changed-surface suite: 346 passed\n- JavaScript syntax, Git diff integrity, installer pins, and AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md identity verified\n- v4.12.0 wheel rebuilt reproducibly with SHA-256 `012b5e42e1f9bbef031845625d67568a79f7dcd0aba91fc5702151f5cebf7255`\n\n## Release note\n\nAfter merge, publish the exact v4.12.0 wheel under the `v4.12.0` GitHub release so the pinned Windows and Unix installer URLs become live.",
